# Hollowtrunk Grove (CIPlay hollowtrunk_grove): the greenhouse round 0 -40, the water tower -16 -46, the zipline from
# trunk 2 to trunk 4 (-20 28), trunk 4's deck -22 30, the seed store 6 14, the root hole -6 2.
island Hollowtrunk Grove
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -8.8; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 8.8
expect step 0
expect title The Hollow Trees
zone greenhouse
expect step 1
read Seedkeeper's watering rota
expect step 2
open Water tower tank
wait 3
expect step 3
zone trunk_4
expect step 4
open Trunk store
wait 3
expect step 5
open Crown box
wait 3
expect step 6
open Beekeepers' box
use trunk5vines
expect shown trunk5chest
open Trunk 5 chest
wait 2
expect step 7
expect hidden seedstore
use towerpump
expect story pumppart 0
expect shown seedstore
expect step 8
open Seed store
wait 3
expect step 9
open Seed drawers
wait 2
expect step 10
read Ranger log 6
expect step 11
zone roots
expect done
